/Users/mac/Desktop/Terminal Bench/Terminal_2.0_Harbor_Harness/Input_Bundle_QC/05_Alignment_Integrity_QC.md:53:- AL-12 Grader influence: could the agent's artifacts shadow a tool, monkey-patch a module, or pre-write a file the verifier trusts? Remember artifacts land at their exact declared absolute paths in the verifier container - check that neither test.sh nor any check in test_output.py executes or imports anything from agent-written paths except deliberately running the declared artifacts as subprocesses.
